MSTAR Public Release License Notice
====================================

The MSTAR (Moving and Stationary Target Acquisition and Recognition) dataset
contained in this repository was publicly released by the U.S. Department of
Defense (specifically the Air Force Research Laboratory, AFRL) for research
purposes.

This redistribution is provided "as-is" for non-commercial academic research
and educational use only. Users of this dataset agree to:

  1. Use the data solely for research and educational purposes.
  2. Not redistribute the data as part of any commercial product or service.
  3. Cite the original MSTAR public release in any publication that results
     from its use (see README.md for the standard citation).
  4. Acknowledge that the data is provided without any warranty of any kind.

The U.S. Government and the maintainers of this mirror assume no responsibility
for the use, misuse, or results obtained from this data.

For the original distribution terms, contact the Sensors Directorate of the
Air Force Research Laboratory (AFRL/RYAP), Wright-Patterson Air Force Base,
Ohio, USA.
